    {
      "text": "用不同方式激活弓箭塔，再与弹球和遗物联动打出毁灭性连击",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Use the archer towers to kill the enemies with arrows that you will activate in different ways. Using them in combination with some balls and artifacts will create powerful combo shots that will obliterate your enemies.",
