      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "积攒法力后直接操纵弹球轨迹，把失控反弹改写成定点进攻",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You will move the ball using the ultimate magic when you have enough mana. This will allow you to change the ball's course and move it to where you want it.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3617290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "击败最终Boss后进入无限模式，用成型牌组挑战能坚持多久",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Infinity mode: After you defeat the final boss with your deck, test the limit of the deck, going as long as you can!",
